          "anvayaIndex": 1,
          "verseIndex": 0
        },
        {
          "itrans": "lakSmaNaH priitaH abhavat",
          "iast": "lakṣmaṇaḥ prītaḥ abhavat",
          "devanagari": "लक्ष्मणः प्रीतः अभवत्",
          "meaning": "Lakshmana, pleased, he became",
          "anvayaIndex": 2,
          "verseIndex": 5
        },
        {
          "itrans": "premNaa idam uvaaca ha",
          "iast": "premṇā idam uvāca ha",
          "devanagari": "प्रेम्णा इदं उवाच ह",
          "meaning": "with friendliness, this, said, indeed.",
          "anvayaIndex": 3,
          "verseIndex": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.36.13",
      "label": "4.36.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "सर्वथा हि मम भ्राता स नाथो वानरेश्वर |\nत्वया नाथेन सुग्रीव प्रश्रितेन विशेषतः",
      "iast": "sarvathā hi mama bhrātā sa nātho vānareśvara |\ntvayā nāthena sugrīva praśritena viśeṣataḥ",
      "translation": "\"In anyway, my brother indeed has a defender with him, oh, king of vanara-s Sugreeva, especially you, who are a defender of your own word and a deferential one towards Rama.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
