          "anvayaIndex": 6,
          "verseIndex": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.36.15",
      "label": "4.36.15",
      "numbers": [
        15
      ],
      "devanagari": "सहायेन च सुग्रीव त्वया रामः प्रतापवान् |\nवधिष्यति रणे शत्रून् अचिरात् न अत्र संशयः",
      "iast": "sahāyena ca sugrīva tvayā rāmaḥ pratāpavān |\nvadhiṣyati raṇe śatrūn acirāt na atra saṃśayaḥ",
      "translation": "\"Before long, Sugreeva, dauntless Rama will be eliminating enemies in a war with you as his supporter, there is no doubt about it.",
