          "iast": "upapannam ca yuktam ca",
          "devanagari": "उपपन्नं च युक्तं च",
          "meaning": "conclusive, also, coherent, also.",
          "anvayaIndex": 4,
          "verseIndex": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "4.36.17",
      "label": "4.36.17",
      "numbers": [
        17
      ],
      "devanagari": "दोषज्ञः सति सामर्थ्ये को अन्यो भाषितुम् अर्हति |\nवर्जयित्वा मम ज्येष्ठम् त्वाम् च वानर सत्तम",
      "iast": "doṣajñaḥ sati sāmarthye ko anyo bhāṣitum arhati |\nvar.hjayitvā mama jyeṣṭham tvām ca vānara sattama",
      "translation": "\"Even though one has capability to know his own lapse and speak it up, oh, ablest among Vanara-s, who is he that behoves outspokenly, excepting my elder brother and you.",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "vaanara sattama",
          "iast": "vānara sattama",
          "devanagari": "वानर सत्तम",
          "meaning": "among Vanara-s, oh, ablest one",
